<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>Label2</name>
    <id>11</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Do you want to reset location, visibility, and availability settings
for the selected predefined report options?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>آیا می‌خواهید تنظیمات محل، نمایش و دسترس‌پذیری را
برای گزینه‌های گزارش ازپیش‌تعریف‌شده انتخاب‌شده بازنشانی کنید؟</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Сбросить настройки размещения, видимости и доступности
выбранных предопределенных вариантов отчетов?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Seçilen önceden tanımlanmış uygulama raporu seçeneklerinin konumunu, görünürlüğünü ve kullanılabilirlik 
ayarları sıfırlansın mı?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Đặt lại tùy chỉnh sắp xếp, phần hiện hình và tính khả dụng
của các phương án báo cáo định trước?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Do you want to reset location, visibility, and availability settings
for the selected predefined report options?</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Do you want to reset location, visibility, and availability settings
for the selected predefined report options?</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>Label2ExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>13</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>Label2ContextMenu</name>
      <id>12</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <formatted>true</formatted>
    <type>Label</type>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
      <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>Label1</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Warning. The &lt;b>Reset location settings&lt;/> command cannot be undone.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>هشدار. فرمان &lt;b>بازنشانی تنظیمات محل&lt;/> قابل بازگشت نیست.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Attenzione, l'operazione &quot;&lt;b>Ripristinare le impostazioni del posizionamento&lt;/>&quot; è irreversibile.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Uwaga: operacja &quot;&lt;b> Resetuj ustawienia miejsc docelowych &lt;/>&quot; jest nieodwracalna.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Внимание, операция &quot;&lt;b>Сбросить настройки размещения&lt;/>&quot; необратима.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Uyarı. &quot;&lt;b>Yerleşim ayarlarını sıfırla&lt;/>&quot; işlemi geri alınamaz.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Chú ý, thao tác &quot;&lt;b>Đặt lại tùy chỉnh sắp xếp&lt;/>&quot; là không thể quay lại.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>Label1ExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>3</id>
